OL,3,ASearch launched for boy, 3, missing at
OL,4,Aplayground
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services and members of the
OL,7,Fpublic are searching for a
OL,8,Fthree-year-old boy who went missing at
OL,9,Fa playground.
OL,11,FNoah Woods was with a relative at the
OL,12,Fsmall park at Merriam Close in
OL,13,FBrantham, but "became separated" from
OL,14,Fthem as they left at about 15:00 BST,
OL,15,FSuffolk Police said.
OL,17,FThe toddler, who is partially deaf,
OL,18,Fautistic and non-verbal, was reported
OL,19,Fto have run down a nearby alleyway
OL,20,Ftowards a newbuild housing estate.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
