OL,3,ASearch launched for boy, 3, missing at
OL,4,Aplayground
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We ask local residents to please check
OL,7,Ftheir outbuildings, gardens and sheds,
OL,8,Fand report any sightings to police on
OL,9,F999," Supt Pete Partridge said.
